[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9061.349, "timestamp": "02:31:01", "text": "是的，我会这么做的。我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9071.67, "timestamp": "02:31:11", "text": "嗯，我会添加本地化。在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9076.55, "timestamp": "02:31:16", "text": "这是当地时间吗？呃，时间什么的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9079.59, "timestamp": "02:31:19", "text": "日期和时间属性之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9083.51, "timestamp": "02:31:23", "text": "我们可以把“我们不需要时间”这句话放上去。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9091.91, "timestamp": "02:31:31", "text": "八月"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9094.389, "timestamp": "02:31:34", "text": "30日"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9103.83, "timestamp": "02:31:43", "text": "为什么是2001年？呃，如何改变2020年？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9108.15, "timestamp": "02:31:48", "text": "是的。然后我可以从这里进行更改。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9111.83, "timestamp": "02:31:51", "text": "正确的。 2020年完整星期日"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9113.99, "timestamp": "02:31:53", "text": "或者简称为“短款”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9116.79, "timestamp": "02:31:56", "text": "会是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9118.95, "timestamp": "02:31:58", "text": "中等的"}]